<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/47/msa@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "\"Akta ibu\", adalah dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 73 seksyen yang berikut: \"Knowingly 73A. Notwithstanding section 24, where a or signature on a cheque is forged or placed thereon negligently facilitating without the authority of the person whose forgery signature it purports to be, and that person whose signature it purports to be knowingly or 2 Rang Undang-Undang negligently contributes to the forgery or the making of the unauthorized signature, the signature shall operate and shall be deemed to be the signature of the person it purports to be in favour of any person who in good faith pays the cheque or takes the cheque for value.\"."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/47/msa@> .
