<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/47/msa@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/name> "Akta ibu adalah dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/47/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/47/msa@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "seksyen 74 seksyen yang berikut: \" Presentment 74A. (1) Notwithstanding section 45, a cheque of cheque is duly presented for payment if the cheque is through presented through a document image processing document image system. processing system. (2) For the purposes of this section, a \"document image processing system\" means a system which permits all forms of documents to be stored, recorded, retrieved, processed or produced by a computer. (3) Where a cheque is presented for payment in accordance with this section, the paying bank may request the collecting bank to— (a) provide it with such further particulars in relation to the cheque as the paying bank deems necessary; and (b) exhibit the cheque or a copy of the cheque.\"."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/47/msa@> .
