<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/47/msa@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "selepas perkataan \"a crossed cheque\" perkataan \"(including a cheque which under section 81A or otherwise is not transferable)\"."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/47/msa@> .
